#. macro: <if ($gn53 > 0)><split " " 1><string $gs1></split><else><split " " 1><string $gs1></split></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_STYRNLONA_000_104:1"
msgid "<if ($gn52 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split><else><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split></if></if>, <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>, I... You have every right to be upset, but..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: だとしたら、気付かずに失礼いたしました。<br>蛮神を討つお役目、どれほど重責であったことでしょう……。
#. de: ... ein kleiner Spaziergang sollte jetzt genau das Richtige sein, um die überhitzten Gemüter abzukühlen. Einen schönen Tag noch.
#. fr: ... Je pense qu'il a compris, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if>.
#. speaker: STYRNLONA
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_STYRNLONA_000_105:1"
msgid "...I think he understands, <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: まったく、なんであんなに怒られなきゃならんのです？<br>もういいです、あとのことは自分でどうにかしますよォ！
#. de: Ich verstehe wirklich nicht, was die Aufregung soll. Aber egal. Jetzt muss ich mich um mein Geschäft kümmern.
#. fr: Cela n'arrivera plus, je vous le promets<nbsp>!
#. speaker: MERCHANT02057
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_MERCHANT02057_000_110:1"
msgid "Never again, <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>! I promise!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 蛮神「リヴァイアサン」討伐作戦へのご案内は、<br>私が担当させていただきました。<br>しかし、あのような方はいらっしゃったでしょうか……？
#. de: Ich habe dich doch damals zu Leviathan gefahren ... Du warst voller Tatendrang ...
#. fr: Était-il nécessaire d'aller si loin, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if>...<nbsp>?
#. speaker: STYRNLONA
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_STYRNLONA_000_115:1"
msgid "Honestly, <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>. I...I don't think you had to..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ごめん、<split " " 1><string $gs1></split>……。<br>取り乱して、つい余計なことを言った。
#. de: Das musste einfach mal gesagt werden. Meinst du nicht?
#. fr: Ça ne peut pas continuer comme ça, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>.
#. speaker: FRAY
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_110:1"
msgid "We can't keep doing this, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. You must see now what it's doing to us... What they're doing to us..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: そうでなくとも、「暗黒騎士」の指導者らしいことは、<br>どんどんできなくなってきてるって、わかっています。<br>疑いますよね、僕のこと……。
#. de: Also wirklich, so ein undankbares Pack ... 
#. fr: Ces... ces <i>gens</i>...
#. speaker: FRAY
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_100_110:1"
msgid "These...these <i>people</i>..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 何と声をかける？
#. de: Wie antwortest du?
#. fr: Que dites-vous<nbsp>?
#. speaker: Q2
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_Q2_000_111:1"
msgid "What will you say?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: あの声の主は、本当に存在する<if $gn4>の<else>のか</if>？
#. de: Alles, was zählt, ist die Stimme.
#. fr: Peu importe. Seule la voix compte pour moi.
#. speaker: A2
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_A2_000_112:1"
msgid "Never mind them. The voice is all that matters."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 本当の暗黒騎士になれない？
#. de: Ich will so schnell wie möglich zu <if $gn4>einer echten Dunkelritterin<else>einem echten Dunkelritter</if> werden.
#. fr: Je n'ai pas besoin d'eux pour être un chevalier noir.
#. speaker: A2
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_A2_000_113:1"
msgid "We don't need them to become a dark knight."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 怒ってくれて、ありがとう！
#. de: Du hast vollkommen Recht. Das musste mal gesagt werden.
#. fr: Il l'a bien mérité<nbsp>!
#. speaker: A2
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_A2_000_114:1"
msgid "He deserved it. Every word."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 存在するよ……。<br>今だって、君が見つけてくれるのを待っているんです。<br>……お願いだから、いないなんて、言わないで。
#. de: Richtig, die Stimme. Du darfst sie nicht ignorieren. Das hieße, deine eigene Existenz zu ignorieren.
#. fr: Oui, tu as raison. Tu dois tendre l'oreille, écouter chacun de ses mots pour découvrir ta vocation.
#. speaker: FRAY
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_120:1"
msgid "Yes...yes, you are right. You must hearken to its words and discover your true calling."
msgstr ""

#. ja: でも、僕が嘘をついていたのも本当だ。<br>……僕は、「声」の主が誰であるか知っています。
#. de: Ich weiß sogar, wem die Stimme gehört ...
#. fr: Tu es proche, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. Si proche...
#. speaker: FRAY
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_121:1"
msgid "You are close, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>─so very, very close..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ただし、その答えを僕から教えることはできないんだ。<br>君自身が、あの「声」の主を……<br>君にとっての最も「弱き者」を見つけなければ意味がない。
#. de: Aber ich kann dir nicht sagen, wer es ist. Du musst es selber herausfinden.
#. fr: J'aimerais tout t'expliquer. J'aimerais te montrer...
#. speaker: FRAY
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_122:1"
msgid "I wish I could tell you. I wish I could <i>make</i> you see."
msgstr ""

#. ja: だから、ねえ……もう一度、儀式を…………。
#. de: Also, fahren wir fort. Strecke deine Hand aus ...
#. fr: Mais tout ce que je peux faire, c'est te guider sur la voie...
#. speaker: FRAY
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_123:1"
msgid "But all I can do is guide you on your journey..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……君は、確かに「暗黒騎士」だ。<br>その身にまとった「暗黒」の力も、<br>鍛錬で身に着けてきた技も、偽物なんかじゃない……。
#. de: Du bist bereits <if $gn4>eine echte Dunkelritterin<else>ein echter Dunkelritter</if>, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. Die Dunkle Macht, sie ist echt.
#. fr: C'est faux, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. Dans un certain sens, ils te servent à développer ton côté obscur. Mais tu n'as plus besoin d'eux, maintenant.
#. speaker: FRAY
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_125:1"
msgid "Not entirely true, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. They have helped you to cultivate the darkness within, in a way. But their help is no longer needed."
msgstr ""

#. ja: でも、皇都で娘さんを助けにいくとき、<br>僕が語った「暗黒騎士の最初の課題」を覚えていますか？
#. de: Aber weißt du noch, was ich in den Schwaden zu dir gesagt habe? Dass du dich deinen Gefühlen stellen musst, wenn du den Weg des Dunkelritters beschreiten möchtest - wenn du ihn überleben möchtest?
#. fr: Il te suffit désormais d'écouter at<shy>ten<shy>ti<shy>ve<shy>ment la voix, de comprendre le sens de ses mots pour découvrir ta vocation.
#. speaker: FRAY
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_126:1"
msgid "All that remains is to hearken to the voice─to grasp its words and discover your true calling."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 君はまだ、その課題を乗り越えていないんだ……。<br>僕が、君に「暗黒」の力を授けられる理由だって、<br>紐解けちゃいないでしょう……？
#. de: Du bist noch nicht am Ziel. Es gibt einen Ort in deinem Herzen, dem du dich noch nicht gestellt hast. Aber die Stimme wird dir dabei helfen.
#. fr: J'aimerais tout t'expliquer. J'aimerais te montrer...
#. speaker: FRAY
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_127:1"
msgid "I wish I could tell you. I wish I could <i>make</i> you see."
msgstr ""

#. ja: すべては、あの「声」の主にたどり着けたらわかることです。<br>だから、ねえ……もう一度、儀式を…………。
#. de: Also, fahren wir fort. Strecke deine Hand aus ...
#. fr: Mais tout ce que je peux faire, c'est te guider sur la voie...
#. speaker: FRAY
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_128:1"
msgid "But all I can do is guide you on your journey..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: …………っ！<br>あ、あたりまえじゃないですか……！<br>あんなの怒ります……今までだって、怒ってました……！
#. de: Findest du auch, dass ich Recht hatte? Sehr gut, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>!
#. fr: Ha ha ha<nbsp>! Tu as bien raison, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>!
#. speaker: FRAY
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_130:1"
msgid "Hah...hahaha! Right you are, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>! Right you are!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 僕に感謝を言うくらいなら、君が怒ればよかったんです。<br>そんなに誰にでも優しいから、<br>あの「声」の主だって、すねて出てこないんじゃないですか！？
#. de: Ich weiß, dass es nicht deine Art ist, sich so aufzuregen. Aber das kannst du getrost mir überlassen.
#. fr: Ça m'a fait du bien<nbsp>! Ce pleutre tremblait tellement que j'ai cru qu'il allait se faire dessus<nbsp>!
#. speaker: FRAY
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_131:1"
msgid "Felt good, didn't it? Seeing that sniveling wretch tremble. I think he nearly pissed himself!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 本当に、もう……君って人は…………。<br>「暗黒騎士」に向いているんだか、いないんだか……。
#. de: Ich freue mich, dass du es endlich erkennst ...
#. fr: Je vois que tu commences enfin à les voir tels qu'ils sont. C'est bien.
#. speaker: FRAY
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_132:1"
msgid "You're finally starting to see them for what they are now, aren't you? Good, good."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……でも、そんな君だからこそ「声」の主を見つけてほしいんだ。<br>大事なことは何ひとつ明かせない、不誠実な僕ですが、<br>この気持ちだけは真実なんです……だから、儀式を…………。
#. de: Umso wichtiger ist es nun, dass du herausbekommst, wem die Stimme gehört. Und ihre wahre Bedeutung erfährst. Strecke deine Hand aus ...
#. fr: Il te suffit désormais d'écouter at<shy>ten<shy>ti<shy>ve<shy>ment la voix, de comprendre le sens de ses mots pour découvrir ta vocation.
#. speaker: FRAY
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_133:1"
msgid "All that remains is to hearken to the voice─to grasp its words and discover your true calling..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 胸を焼くような思いとともに、「声」が脳裏に響いてくる……。
#. de: Du spürst ein tiefes Brennen in deiner Brust, und die Stimmen abertausend Leidender und Hilfsbedürftiger klingen in deinem Herzen wider. Dann formen sich Worte ...
#. fr: Chaque respiration vous rend plus <if $gn4>légère<else>léger</if> et vous fait glisser peu à peu dans les ténèbres...
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_SYSTEM_000_140:1"
msgid "With every breath you grow lighter and slip further into the abyss..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: (-？？？？-)…………声が聞こえる。<br>誰かが助けを求める声だ……。<br>なんて……やかましいんだろう………。
#. de: (-???-)Die Schwachen rufen dich, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. Wie sie es immer tun.
#. fr: (-???-)La foule se rassemble pour acclamer son <if $gn4>héroïne<else>héros</if>.
#. speaker: FRAY
#. macro: <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_141:1"
msgid "(-???-)A chorus of voices cries out for a hero, and <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> comes."
msgstr ""

#. ja: (-？？？？-)彼らの声に、自分の声はかき消されてしまう……。<br>この痛みを……怒りを……悲しみを……<br>どうやったら伝えられる……？
#. de: (-???-)Sie rufen, sie schreien, sie kreischen ... So laut, dass man seine eigene Stimme nicht hört ...<br>Die Schmerzen ... der Zorn ... die Trauer ... Davon will niemand etwas hören.
#. fr: (-???-)<if $gn4>Elle<else>Il</if> sourit, <if $gn4>elle<else>il</if> acquiesce, et <if $gn4>elle<else>il</if> reste silencieu<if $gn4>se<else>x</if>...
#. speaker: FRAY
#. macro: <if $gn4>She<else>He</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_142:1"
msgid "(-???-)<if $gn4>She<else>He</if> smiles. <if $gn4>She<else>He</if> nods. And <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> remains silent..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: (-？？？？-)…………ああ、そうだ。<br>自分の声でだめなら、他人の声を使えばいい……。<br>その声も届かないなら、同じ痛みをもって、伝えればいい……。
#. de: (-???-)Aber du. Du wirst hinhören.
#. fr: (-???-)Mais <if $gn4>elle<else>il</if> a une voix, <if $gn4>elle<else>lui</if> aussi...
#. speaker: FRAY
#. macro: <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_143:1"
msgid "(-???-)But <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> too has a voice..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: (-？？？？-)そうでしょう……？<br>待っていて………………
#. de: (-???-)Du erhörst mich.
#. fr: (-???-)Un jour, je me ferai entendre...
#. speaker: FRAY
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_144:1"
msgid "(-???-)I will be heard..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ねえ……<br><string $gs1>…………。
#. de: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>.
#. fr: ... <string $gs1>.
#. speaker: FRAY
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_145:1"
msgid "...<string $gs1>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……「声」は、聞こえたみたいですね。
#. de: Du hast die Stimme gehört, stimmt's?
#. fr: ... Tu es au bord du précipice, mais tu ne dois pas craindre la chute.
#. speaker: FRAY
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_146:1"
msgid "...You stand at the precipice, but do not fear the fall."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 君が何を聞き、何を思ったかは、あえて問いません。<br>ただ、今度こそ、護るべき「誰か」のために、<br>すべてを捨てる覚悟ができたなら……
#. de: Du brauchst mir nicht zu sagen, was du gehört hast. Aber ich frage dich eins: Bist du bereit, alles aufzugeben, um der Stimme zu antworten?
#. fr: Il te suffirait de te jeter dans les abysses pour mieux t'élever vers les cieux, enfin libre.
#. speaker: FRAY
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_147:1"
msgid "Cast yourself into the abyss, and you shall soar above, free at last."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 英雄として築いた地位や名声、居場所を捨てても、<br>それを護りたいと思えたならば、<br>僕と一緒に、このエオルゼアを出てください。
#. de: Deinen Stand, deinen Ruf, dein Vermögen - alles? Erst nachdem wir alles verloren haben, haben wir die Freiheit, alles zu tun. Wenn du dazu bereit bist, dann ... komm mit mir! Verlasse dieses Eorzea! 
#. fr: Il existe d'autres terres, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. Des contrées où personne ne te connaît. Si c'est ce que tu désires, nous pouvons quitter cet endroit à tout jamais.
#. speaker: FRAY
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_148:1"
msgid "There are other lands than these, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>─lands where we are not known. Ask, and we shall quit this place forever."
msgstr ""

#. ja: この地では、君はたったひとりを護る存在にはなれない。<br>離れてこそ……本当の「暗黒騎士」としての物語がはじまるんだ。
#. de: Hier wirst du nie in der Lage sein, deine Bestimmung zu erfüllen. Wirklich frei zu sein. Hier wirst du dich immer auch um andere kümmern müssen. Wenn du aber Eorzea den Rücken zukehrst - kannst du deinen Weg gehen. 
#. fr: Ce n'est qu'en renonçant à ce que tu es que tu seras com<shy>plè<shy>te<shy>ment libéré<if $gn4>e</if>.
#. speaker: FRAY
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_149:1"
msgid "Only when you have renounced everything are you free to do anything."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……君を、いつもの場所で待っています。<br>ただ、僕にはあまり時間がないらしい……。<br>遠くない再会を願っていますよ。
#. de: Du brauchst jetzt nicht zu antworten. Triff mich am gleichen Ort wie immer, wenn du so weit bist. Ich werde auf dich warten.
#. fr: Quand nous nous reverrons, tu me donneras ta réponse.
#. speaker: FRAY
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_000_150:1"
msgid "When we meet again, you will give us your answer."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 商品奪還のため、キキルン族を倒せ！
#. de: Nimm den Qiqirn die Waren ab!
#. fr: Massacrez les Qiqirns<nbsp>!
#. kind: other
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_QIB_001_TODO_1:1"
msgid "Slaughter the Qiqirn!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 奪われた商品を奪還しろ！
#. de: Sammle die gestohlenen Waren ein!
#. fr: Reprenez les mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses volées<nbsp>!
#. kind: other
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_QIB_001_TODO_2:1"
msgid "Retrieve the stolen goods!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: かなりの多勢ですね……。<br>盗人キキルンを倒してから、荷物を取り返しましょう……。
#. de: Das sind ja ganz schön viele ... Das wird ein schönes Blutbad.
#. fr: Faibles... mais nombreux. Débarrassons-nous d'eux.
#. kind: other
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_BATTLETALK_01:1"
msgid "Weak...but plentiful. They may yet suffice..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: これこれ、ぜーんぶ、ヨヨルンの！<br>ものども、こいつを追い返すっちゃ！
#. de: Das alles meine sein, Finger weg von Yoyoroons Sachen!
#. fr: Yoyoroon pas peur<nbsp>! Yoyoroon vous tuer et voler tous vos trésors<nbsp>!
#. kind: other
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_BOSS_BATTLETALK_01:1"
msgid "Yoyoroon not afraid! Yoyoroon kill you and loot your loots!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: お見事です、あとは商品の回収だけだ。<br><split " " 1><string $gs1></split>、お願いできますか……？
#. de: Jetzt nur noch die Waren einsammeln!
#. fr: Hé hé... Tenace, le bougre. Bon, les mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses, maintenant.
#. kind: other
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_BATTLETALK_04:1"
msgid "Heh...heh... Tenacious bastards... Right, then. The goods."
msgstr ""

#. ja: その木箱に、商品が入ってるようですね。<br>よし……これでどうにか………………ウッ……。
#. de: Die Waren sind bestimmt in dieser Holzkiste ...
#. fr: Bien, on dirait que tout y est.
#. kind: other
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_BATTLETALK_05:1"
msgid "Good. There's nothing left here for...for..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ハァ……ハァ……。<br>だめだ、体がもう……うまく動かない……！
#. de: Nein, nicht jetzt! Wir waren so nah dran ...
#. fr: Non<nbsp>! Si près du but...<nbsp>!
#. kind: other
msgctxt "quest/020/JobDrk450_02057:TEXT_JOBDRK450_02057_FRAY_BATTLETALK_02:1"
msgid "Not now, dammit! Not when we're so close!"
msgstr ""
